---
description: Next.js App Router API route patterns for Notely
globs: src/app/api/**/*.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

# API routes

- Default export style: named `GET` / `POST` / `PATCH` / `DELETE` handlers
- Private notes routes: start with `requireSession()`; return `response` when unauthenticated
- Validate with Zod (`safeParse`); on failure use `jsonError(...)` from `@/lib/api/auth-guard`
- Call `src/lib/notes/**` or `src/lib/db` — keep DB details out of the route file when possible
- Return `NextResponse.json(...)`; use `jsonError(message, status)` for errors
- Auth catch-all stays at `src/app/api/auth/[...all]/route.ts` — do not duplicate Better Auth handlers
